iNiR is licensed under GPL-3.0-only. Its LICENSE and original notices are retained.
This standalone runtime carries Ryoku's tested integration patches from
Ryoku-on-NixOS, including the panel families, visualisers, wallpaper,
theme/colour bridges and managed session hooks. Arch starts the bundled
runtime only through the Ryoku shell supervisor. Arch's previous embedded
iRiS source is retained intact for fallback and compatibility.
This complete runtime remains opt-in pending validation on an Arch session.
